We sold out in two hours. If you wanted tamales, you had to get there first, okay? Because within two hours, they were sold. Politicians that came in said, we're just in here for tamales. And it was like, hey, you're late. They're gone. The Levee festivals were really successful fundraisers. They made it possible for the town to hire a lawyer who knew
我们在两个小时内就卖光了。如果你想要玉米粉蒸肉，你得先到那儿，好吧？因为在两个小时内，它们就卖光了。来的政客们说，我们是专门来吃玉米粉蒸肉的。而我们的反应是，嘿，你们来晚了。卖完了。堤防节是非常成功的筹款活动。它们让该镇有可能聘请一位精通

