And all I could think of is if my grandfather knew what I was doing right now, he'd be so upset. And for his part, Ryan certainly never thought he was ever going to be a part of an effort to build a levee. In fact, Ryan had spent much of his career trying to undo all the damage that levees had caused. Because you look at a levee, it's like, oh, that's bad for the ecosystem, right? In order to better understand why levees have traditionally been so bad for the rivers of the Central Valley,
我脑子里想的唯独一件事就是，如果我爷爷知道我现在在做什么，他一定会非常生气的。就瑞安而言，他绝对从未想过自己会参与建造堤防的努力。事实上，瑞安职业生涯的大部分时间都在试图消除堤防造成的破坏。因为你看一个堤防，就会觉得，哦，这对生态系统不好，对吧？为了更好地了解为什么传统上堤防对中央谷地的河流一直这么糟糕，

