00:20:36.000 --> 00:21:00.000
It was covered with a vast mosaic of riparian forests and wetlands that were tended by different indigenous groups. There were tuli elk roaming through the marshlands and grizzly bears feeding on the massive salmon runs. They talk about the salmon run was so immense that at night you could hardly sleep sometimes because there's so many salmon coming up the river, you could just hear them.
这里长满了由不同原住民群体照料的河岸森林和湿地大拼图。有罗斯福马鹿在沼泽地里漫步，灰熊则以庞大的鲑鱼群为食。他们说鲑鱼洄游的规模太大了，以至于有时晚上你根本无法入睡，因为有那么多的鲑鱼逆流而上，你光是听都能听到它们的声音。

