00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:46.000
because when levees are built right up against the banks of the river, the water has nowhere to go. It can't spread out like it once did. And if there's a big storm, like the ones we should expect with climate change, the river just gushes through the channel with increasing ferocity.
因为当堤防紧贴着河岸修建时，水无处可去。它无法像以前那样扩散开来。如果有大风暴，就像我们因气候变化而应该预期的那样，河水就会以越来越猛烈的势头从河道中喷涌而出。

