I mean, you have to go convince Congress in person. What they will tell you is, you got to get the funding from Congress. You have to go to Washington seeking those funds. Coming up after the break, Jose and Leanne go to Washington. When we left off off it was 2004. Jose and Leanne and Ryan had just managed to get approval for a feasibility study for their setback levy. But Congress
我的意思是，你必须亲自去国会说服他们。他们会告诉你的是，你得从国会获得资金。你必须去华盛顿寻求这些资金。中场休息后即将播出，何塞和莉安前往华盛顿。当我们中断时，时间是2004年。何塞、莉安和瑞安刚刚设法获得了他们退堤计划可行性研究的批准。但国会

