their lawyers went all the way to Washington, D.C. to try and convince a bunch of suits on Capitol Hill that little old Hamilton City deserved a levy more than all of the other cities and towns in the country. When the team first arrived in Washington, they got a little boost when they learned that legend of the Hamilton City Levee festivals preceded them. When we went back to Washington, DC, we were at the Pentagon. The first thing that came I was getting a tamales. We did not bring your tamales to the Pentagon. Sorry. We didn't think that they would allow them to come in here. They go like, hey, trust me, they got in.
