happen. Just that little bit of movement that got us back into where we were, okay, we can do this. We can do this. I think part of the reason they were able to keep the faith was that the project just felt like it made too much sense not to happen. Farmers liked it. Environmentalists liked it.
发生。正是那一点点的进展，让我们重回正轨，心想：好吧，我们能做到。我们能做到。我想他们能够保持信念的部分原因在于，这个项目本身让人觉得实在太合情合理了，不可能不成功。农民喜欢它。环保主义者喜欢它。

71
