had a cocktail and said, thank you, Lord Jesus. Thank you, Lord, because it just took so long. You may have noticed that there hasn't been a whole lot of talk about climate change in the story up until this point. That's mostly because when Jose and Leanne were getting started with all this, climate change was a distant threat in people's imaginations. But it's not a distant threat anymore. And as people in California struggle to cope with drought and deluge, the Hamilton City Setback Levy is starting to look like money very well spent. Because it turns out one of the best tools to prepare for extreme rainstorms and big flooding events
