in an era of supercharged rainstorms. Not just in California, but the entire country. And what's frustrating about that is that you would think because it checks all the boxes, well, why isn't it being replicated? Some aspects of the project are being replicated. The Army Corps of Engineers recently built a brand new setback levy downriver from Hamilton City in West Sacramento. And all throughout the country, from Northern California
不仅在加州，而且在全美都是如此。令人沮丧的是，你会想，既然它符合所有条件，那为什么没有被复制推广呢？项目的一些方面正在被复制。陆军工程兵团最近在西萨克拉门托市汉密尔顿城下游修建了一座崭新的后退堤坝。在全国各地，从北加州

